00", "image": "engenn3le03ob01re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, yes. How is she?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: She's well, thanks.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, in that case, let's go for a matin\u00e9e then.", "id": 6, "time": "43000", "image": "engenn3le03ob01re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn3le03ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le03ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}